                                                "sense_id": "a0c40db8-a8d0-38fc-97a8-5c9bd194ec26",
                                                "text": "I say this because, according to the old Jerusalemites, the building blocks of the world and its inhabitants were formed of the alphabet at the back of God's tongue when He pronounced the world […]."
